And not ASDF JKL;
asdf jkl;

I'm an *editor*. For sure. I'm a writer... I will not be humble about those. I am a damned fine educator. I am a photographer. I build cameras out of Keebler tins and magnifying lenses and develop the photos in my bathtub. I'm happy to call myself more of a photographer than many. I am perhaps among the great science educators of my generation and a damn fine writer when I want to be. But scientist? Physicist?? Not unless I'm right. Then I'll own it. It's precision. And reverence. And just damned politeness.

